text = "[color=b6ae9a][b][i][font_size=27]Interim[/font_size][/i][/b] is a narrative experience exploring grief, loss, and complex human experiences. In playing, you will encounter themes and depictions of self-harm, physical injury, violence towards others, and substance misuse.

If this experience provokes difficult feelings or thoughts of harming yourself, please seek support. You are not alone.

[b][i][font_size=27]United States:[/font_size][/i][/b] Call or text 988 to reach the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline.

[b][i][font_size=27]Outside the United States:[/font_size][/i][/b] Visit [url=www.findahelpline.com]findahelpline.com[/url] to find support resources in your country.

[i][font_size=27]There are also flickering lights (these can be reduced in [b]Options[/b]).[/font_size][/i][/color]"
fit_content = true
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
